{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46097","headline":"送罗邺赴许昌辟 · 贯休","name":"送罗邺赴许昌辟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方得论心又别离，黯然江上步迟迟。\n不堪回首崎岖路，正是寒风皴错时。\n美似郄超终有日，去依刘表更何疑。\n前程不少南飞鴈，聊寄新诗慰所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}